'''Summoner Satoru''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during [[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]] event. He was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.2 Update|Version 12.2]] increases health and Shield Piercing chance, and also gains the Knockback ability. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 14.4 Update|Version 14.4]].

