==Trivia==
*All three of Satoru's forms heavily reference the main character of "[[wikipedia:Yo-kai Watch|Yo-kai Watch]]", [[wikia:yokaiwatch:Nathan Adams|Nathan Adams]].
*Satoru is a common masculine Japanese name nominalized from the verb 悟る, meaning "to know" or "understand". There are several other meanings it can have depending on which kanji is used to spell it, such as "dawn" (暁), "to awaken" (覚), and "intelligence" or "clever" (賢), however, the unit's name is written in katakana (サトル).

